## PHASE 1 — Security Hardening (P0)

- Remove the JWT secret fallback (`change-me-in-env`) — hard-fail startup if `.env` doesn't load.
- Replace wildcard CORS with an explicit origin allow-list.
- Move WebSocket JWT out of the query string (initial WS message payload or short-lived signed ticket).
- Add refresh-token revocation/rotation on logout.
- Add rate limiting on `/api/auth/login` and `/api/auth/register`.
- Fix the bcrypt/passlib version warning.

**Exit criterion:** no default secrets, no wildcard CORS, WS auth off the URL, revocation working, rate limiting confirmed with a repeated-failure test.

